SCOPE

The licence above covers the source code of this repository.

It does not cover the exercise illustrations in `public/exercises/` or the
images referenced by remote URL in the seed routines. Those are crops of the
Horizon Torus 5 Exercise Guide, reproduced here for personal use. They belong to
their owner, and no rights to them are granted or implied. Anyone reusing this
code should supply their own illustrations. `scripts/exercise_plates.py` shows
how the set is produced from a guide PDF.

`src/audio/referee-whistle-cc0.wav` is a Creative Commons 0 1.0 public domain
recording by SpliceSound (freesound.org sound 218318), prepared as described in
`src/audio/samples.ts`. CC0 requires no attribution.
